    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d129">

                <pb facs="0245" n="145" sameAs="frus:frus1934v02/pg145"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.60d31/80: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Finland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Albright</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Helsingfors</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-08-21T11:00:00+02:00">August 21, 1934—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 21—9:25 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Following Mr. Sayre’s informal conversation Finnish authorities during recent
                    visit and my later conversation with Acting Foreign Minister I am now informed
                    by him that Finnish Government will send expert Washington about October
                    1st.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Albright</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
